    "ASSET_CRITICALITY": {

        "_comment": [
            "Asset/system criticality. This is the importance of the ASSET, not",
            "the severity of the ALERT, and it is a separate axis from",
            "SECURITY_SEVERITY (alert_context.severity).",
            "",
            "The destination asset_context.criticality already existed in",
            "canonical_schema.json, is declared as the ASSET_CONTEXT indicator",
            "'criticality' in framework/ontology/security_ontology.py, and is the",
            "required evidence of the existing ASSET_CRITICALITY_RISK feature in",
            "framework/features/feature_registry.py. Only the concept declaration",
            "itself was missing, so the field could never be populated and the",
            "feature could never become AVAILABLE."
        ],

        "canonical_path":
        "asset_context.criticality"

    },


